  loreSource: "Desk drawer, the Study"
  loreText: "Gentlemen of the Society, I can now confirm the Tree holds not one crystal but three, sealed beneath the bark in three distinct layers. We will draw them out for study this spring, beginning with the darkest. The Tree is very old and very large, and I cannot believe it will miss them for a season."
